<item><title>Soutra Money earns top-tier payment security certification</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/soutra-money-earns-top-tier-payment-security-certification-e68c9b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/soutra-money-earns-top-tier-payment-security-certification-e68c9b/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The Guinean fintech says its PCI DSS level 1 status follows a full audit and requires annual reviews of its payment systems and data safeguards.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:31:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>CBG outlines alumina refinery plan at Conakry mining summit</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/cbg-outlines-alumina-refinery-plan-at-conakry-mining-summit-1fb055/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/cbg-outlines-alumina-refinery-plan-at-conakry-mining-summit-1fb055/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The Guinean bauxite producer said construction work has begun and it expects to invite guests to a possible opening three years from next year.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:29:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/cbg-outlines-alumina-refinery-plan-at-conakry-mining-summit-1fb055/share.jpg" length="41324" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/cbg-outlines-alumina-refinery-plan-at-conakry-mining-summit-1fb055/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
